refused
refused-image-notes-place.md:3: image: .learn/bully/notes/ring.svg is in the notes of the course bully, and this page belongs to the course raft: put the file under .learn/raft/notes/
refused-image-notes-place.md:5: image: .learn/raft/ring.svg is a file of the store of qlearn, and a page shows only the notes of its course: put the image under .learn/raft/notes/
refused-image-notes-place.md:7: image: .learn/raft/notes/gone.svg is not there: write the file before the push
refused-image-notes-place.md:9: image: .learn/raft/notes/away.svg leads out of the notes of the course: copy the file into .learn/raft/notes/ in place of a link
refused-image-notes-place.md:11: image: .learn/raft/notes/out/away.svg leads out of the notes of the course: copy the file into .learn/raft/notes/ in place of a link
refused-image-notes-place.md:13: image: .learn/raft/notes/folder.svg is a directory: name an image file inside it
refused-image-notes-place.md:15: image: .learn/raft/notes/pipe.svg is not a regular file: put the image itself there
